# <type>(<optional scope>): <subject>   (max ~72 chars, imperative mood)
#
# <blank line>
# <body: what & why, not how. wrap at 72.>
#
# <blank line>
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Refs #123, Co-authored-by: ...>
#
# Allowed types:
#   feat     A new feature
#   fix      A bug fix
#   docs     Documentation only
#   style    Formatting; no code-behaviour change
#   refactor Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
#   perf     Performance improvement
#   test     Adding or correcting tests
#   build    Build system, XcodeGen, scripts, entitlements
#   ci       CI configuration
#   chore    Housekeeping (no src or test change)
#   revert   Reverts a previous commit
